  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "SolarEdge: Fix buffer overflow",
  "description": "The final decrypted output is 6 bytes shorter than the intermediate\noutput, because the first six bytes are used for a sequence number\n(not currently dissected or added to the tree) and 4 bytes that\nare used to XOR over the others.\n\nAlso allocate the intermediate result initially with tvb_memdup to\nreduce the number of instructions and prevent Coverity CID 1499456.\n\nNote that this buffer overflow requires manually setting the preference\nfor a server key and manually specifying Decode As with the SolarEdge\ndissector. (It is also hidden by the wmem block allocation.)\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
